Explanation :

- PriorityQueue stores patients according to their priority.
- Severity 1 represents critical patients and severity 5 represents minor patients.
- Lower severity numbers are treated first.
- The arrival variable maintains the order in which patients arrive.
- If two patients have equal severity, the earlier arrival is treated first.
- poll() removes and returns the highest-priority patient.

Time complexity :

Operation	                        Time complexity
Add patient	                            O(log n)
Remove patient	                        O(log n)
View highest-priority patient	        O(1)
Process all patients	                O(n log n)